1
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:09,180
So… how's your uncle doing?

2
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:18,920
He's fine. He's already been discharged
from the hospital, Earth.

3
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:24,039
I'm sorry. Work has been crazy lately
so I had to go into the office a lot.

4
00:00:26,066 --> 00:00:29,480
And what does KongKongkwan's brother
have anything to do with this?

5
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:36,656
KongKongkwan? Well, my dad's company
had a meeting. so she just went to buy pizza.

6
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:42,730
And besides, my dad's company is one of
their regular customers. Don't you trust me?

7
00:00:47,455 --> 00:00:49,455
Earth…

8
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:55,124
No… I just—

9
00:00:57,079 --> 00:01:02,525
If your uncle didn't want you engaged to KongKongkwan,
I'd probably feel a lot more at ease.

10
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:12,320
Do you want me to take you in front of Kongkwan
right now and tell her I love you?

11
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:17,640
- Huh?
- No— that's not what I mean.

12
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:23,119
Oh? Oh? What's this?
Are you sulking?

13
00:01:23,119 --> 00:01:25,160
- I'm not.
- Let go.

14
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:26,610
You "are" sulking.

15
00:01:26,610 --> 00:01:30,237
- Let go.
- Nope.

16
00:01:31,608 --> 00:01:34,575
- I'm not sulking so don't try to coax me.
- I'm not letting go— nope.
